## Approach

Introduce a `health` module that defines the finding model all biomarkers produce into, implement `nested_complexity` as the first biomarker to prove the full pipeline, and wire health findings into parse + DB + waiver infrastructure. The nested_complexity biomarker reuses the existing cognitive complexity tree-walk classification (`classify_cognitive`) to compute max nesting depth per function, stored alongside cyclomatic/cognitive in the symbols table. Health waivers mirror the constraint waiver pattern (separate durable table, same matching shape) rather than sharing tables, keeping the two domains independently evolvable.

